{"id":"4a8ab8e4bad7b12d","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-generalized-diagonal-lemma.md","title":"Generalized Diagonal Lemma","display":"thm-generalized-diagonal-lemma — Generalized Diagonal Lemma","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-generalized-diagonal-lemma","aliases":["89-thm-generalized-diagonal-lemma"],"display":"thm-generalized-diagonal-lemma — Generalized Diagonal Lemma","depends_on":["[[89-df-arithmetical-language]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus]]","[[89-df-diagonal-lemma]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-generalized-diagonal-lemma"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-generalized-diagonal-lemma</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-generalized-diagonal-lemma — Generalized Diagonal Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a257e5b1de6880b7\" href=\"?note=a257e5b1de6880b7\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-language\">89-df-arithmetical-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2e7227755a8473e0\" href=\"?note=2e7227755a8473e0\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus\">89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2695165f0444a6d1\" href=\"?note=2695165f0444a6d1\" title=\"89-df-diagonal-lemma\">89-df-diagonal-lemma</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\ge1\">\\(k\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\ge0\">\\(m\\ge0\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y_0,\\ldots,y_{k-1},z_1,\\ldots,z_m\">\\(y_0,\\ldots,y_{k-1},z_1,\\ldots,z_m\\)</span> 互异。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_0,\\ldots,P_{k-1}\">\\(P_0,\\ldots,P_{k-1}\\)</span> 为算术公式，全部自由变元包含于上述列表。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>固定原始递归 Gödel 编码、数词及同时避免捕获替换；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner S_i(\\bar z)\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner S_i(\\bar z)\\urcorner\\)</span> 编码的是含显示自由变元的公式，不是其某个实例。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\)</span> 是固定 PA 经典证明关系。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}generalized\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\n\\exists S_0(\\bar z),\\ldots,S_{k-1}(\\bar z)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\ \n\\forall i&lt;k\\ \n\\bigl[\\mathrm{FV}(S_i)\\subseteq\\{\\bar z\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\nS_i(\\bar z)\\leftrightarrow\nP_i(\\overline{\\ulcorner S_0\\urcorner},\\ldots,\n\\overline{\\ulcorner S_{k-1}\\urcorner},\\bar z)\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}generalized\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\n\\exists S_0(\\bar z),\\ldots,S_{k-1}(\\bar z)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\ \n\\forall i&lt;k\\ \n\\bigl[\\mathrm{FV}(S_i)\\subseteq\\{\\bar z\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\nS_i(\\bar z)\\leftrightarrow\nP_i(\\overline{\\ulcorner S_0\\urcorner},\\ldots,\n\\overline{\\ulcorner S_{k-1}\\urcorner},\\bar z)\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 3 章，印刷页 53–55；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n这是带参数的同时对角化，复用单句对角引理的编码机制；单句无参数的 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2695165f0444a6d1\" href=\"?note=2695165f0444a6d1\" title=\"89-df-diagonal-lemma\">89-df-diagonal-lemma</a> 不能直接当作同一签名使用。原书通过表示代入与对角函数给出构造；证明在这些编码函数上进行有限的同时自代入。若输入均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>（或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span>），可取相同复杂度的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_i\">\\(S_i\\)</span>。本条引用原书证明，编码函数的逐条 PA 表示证明未在此重新展开。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-language","status":"resolved","id":"a257e5b1de6880b7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"2e7227755a8473e0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"2695165f0444a6d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-diagonal-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"2695165f0444a6d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"来源：Boolos, *The Logic of Provability*，第 3 章，印刷页 53–55；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n这是带参数的同时对角化，复用单句对角引理的编码机制；单句无参数的 [[89-df-diagonal-lemma]] 不能直接当作同一签名使用。原书通过表示代入与对角函数给出构造；证明在这些编码函数上进行有限的同时自代入。若输入均为 $\\Sigma_1$（或 $\\Pi_1$），可取相同复杂度的 $S_i$。本条引用原书证明，编码函数的逐条 PA 表示证明未在此重新展开。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"m\\ge0","display":false},{"tex":"y_0,\\ldots,y_{k-1},z_1,\\ldots,z_m","display":false},{"tex":"P_0,\\ldots,P_{k-1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner S_i(\\bar z)\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}generalized\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\n\\exists S_0(\\bar z),\\ldots,S_{k-1}(\\bar z)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\ \n\\forall i<k\\ \n\\bigl[\\mathrm{FV}(S_i)\\subseteq\\{\\bar z\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\nS_i(\\bar z)\\leftrightarrow\nP_i(\\overline{\\ulcorner S_0\\urcorner},\\ldots,\n\\overline{\\ulcorner S_{k-1}\\urcorner},\\bar z)\\bigr].","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_1","display":false},{"tex":"S_i","display":false}],"bytes":1871,"backlinks":[{"id":"76b37345e1a3ad95","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a1c8bb923975db7e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-57","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation]] → [[89-thm-generalized-diagonal-lemma]] → [[89-thm-lob-internal]] → [[89-thm-lob-theorem]] → [[89-df-reflection-principle]] → [[89-df-gls-logic]]"}],"outgoing":["a257e5b1de6880b7","2e7227755a8473e0","2695165f0444a6d1"]}